&lt;div class="hx:ltr:pl-3 hx:ltr:pr-2 hx:rtl:pr-3 hx:rtl:pl-2"&gt;&lt;svg height=1.2em class="hx:inline-block hx:align-middle" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:w-full hx:min-w-0 hx:leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:mt-6 hx:leading-7 hx:first:mt-0"&gt;Le emoji sono nella v0.4.0; la v0.3.0 non ne aveva.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scrivi un&amp;rsquo;emoji come shortcode o come carattere stesso:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gh"&gt;# Launch :rocket: 🎉
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Shortcodes :smile: :+1: :heart_eyes: and Unicode 😄 👍🏽 👩‍💻 🇫🇷 1️⃣.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copia codice"
aria-label="Copia codice"
data-copied-label="Copiato!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ciascuna diventa l&amp;rsquo;immagine &lt;a href="https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Twemoji&lt;/a&gt; che Marp Core
disegna, con il markup che Marp Core scrive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-html" data-lang="html"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;img&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;emoji&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;draggable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;false&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;alt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;😄&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;src&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;data:image/svg+xml;base64,…&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;data-marp-twemoji&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copia codice"
aria-label="Copia codice"
data-copied-label="Copiato!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="no-network"&gt;Senza rete&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="no-network"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#no-network" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Link permanente a questa sezione"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Il &lt;code&gt;src&lt;/code&gt; di Marp Core è un URL su una CDN, quindi una presentazione mostrata offline, stampata o
trasformata in PDF su una macchina senza connessione mostra immagini rotte.
go-slides mette l&amp;rsquo;SVG stesso in un URI &lt;code&gt;data:&lt;/code&gt;. Le grafiche (4.009,
Twemoji 17.0.3, Emoji 17.0) sono incorporate nel programma dal modulo in puro Go
&lt;a href="https://github.com/go-icons/twemoji" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;go-icons/twemoji&lt;/a&gt;, 2 MB compressi e
letti solo quando una presentazione contiene un&amp;rsquo;emoji.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le immagini sono disegnate allo stesso modo dalla pagina HTML, da &lt;code&gt;--images&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;--image&lt;/code&gt;, da &lt;code&gt;--pdf&lt;/code&gt;, da
&lt;code&gt;--pptx&lt;/code&gt; e da &lt;code&gt;--odp&lt;/code&gt;: go-webengine rasterizza l&amp;rsquo;SVG. Tutte le 4.009
grafiche vengono analizzate e disegnate dal suo rasterizzatore SVG; lo verifica un test. Dalla
v0.5.0 quel rasterizzatore è &lt;a href="https://github.com/go-gfx/oksvg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;go-gfx/oksvg&lt;/a&gt;
v0.2.0: &lt;code&gt;clipPath&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;fill-rule: evenodd&lt;/code&gt; e i comandi ad arco ora vengono disegnati come li
disegna Chrome, il che ha cambiato una Twemoji e altre 211, e i loghi SVG non
risultano più alterati.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La regola che dimensiona un&amp;rsquo;emoji sul testo (&lt;code&gt;img[data-marp-twemoji]&lt;/code&gt;, un quadrato
di un &lt;code&gt;em&lt;/code&gt;, allineato alla linea di base) viene aggiunta al tema come la aggiunge Marp Core,
quindi la ottiene anche un tema tutto tuo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="what-is-converted"&gt;Cosa viene convertito&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="what-is-converted"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#what-is-converted" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Link permanente a questa sezione"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Le regole sono quelle di Marp Core; un test le confronta con l&amp;rsquo;HTML che Marp Core 4.4.0
scrive per una presentazione contenente ogni caso.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;:smile:&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;:+1:&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;:heart_eyes:&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;i 1.903 nomi di markdown-it-emoji, nel testo, nei titoli, nei link, nelle tabelle, in &lt;code&gt;header&lt;/code&gt; e &lt;code&gt;footer&lt;/code&gt;; non nel codice, negli URL né nel testo alternativo di un&amp;rsquo;immagine&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;😄&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;👩‍💻&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;🇫🇷&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;1️⃣&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;👍🏽&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;emoji Unicode, nel testo &lt;strong&gt;e nel codice&lt;/strong&gt;: Marp Core riscrive l&amp;rsquo;HTML del codice già reso&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;✔&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;©&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;™&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;▶&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;restano testo: i caratteri la cui presentazione predefinita è testuale sono emoji solo con U+FE0F (&lt;code&gt;✔️&lt;/code&gt;); &lt;code&gt;❤&lt;/code&gt; è l&amp;rsquo;eccezione&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;☺︎&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;resta testo: un U+FE0E dopo un&amp;rsquo;emoji richiede il glifo semplice&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;12:30:45&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;:not_a_name:&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;restano come scritti&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L&amp;rsquo;&lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt; di un titolo e l&amp;rsquo;indice usano l&amp;rsquo;emoji, non il nome dello shortcode:
&lt;code&gt;# Launch :rocket:&lt;/code&gt; ha l&amp;rsquo;id &lt;code&gt;launch-%F0%9F%9A%80&lt;/code&gt;, come in Marp.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dove go-slides differisce da Marp Core, converte di più: &lt;code&gt;✌️ ☝️ ✍️ 🏋️&lt;/code&gt; e alcuni
altri caratteri a presentazione testuale che l&amp;rsquo;emoji-regex di Marp Core lascia come testo,
e le poche sequenze che Twemoji disegna e che Unicode non elenca.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="turning-it-off"&gt;Disattivarle&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="turning-it-off"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#turning-it-off" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Link permanente a questa sezione"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;--no-emoji&lt;/code&gt; (nel codice, &lt;code&gt;slides.Config{NoEmoji: true}&lt;/code&gt;) lascia shortcode ed
emoji Unicode come il testo in cui sono stati scritti, ovvero l&amp;rsquo;&lt;code&gt;emoji: false&lt;/code&gt; di
Marp Core.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="attribution"&gt;Attribuzione&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="attribution"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#attribution" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Link permanente a questa sezione"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Le grafiche sono Twemoji, Copyright 2020 Twitter, Inc e altri collaboratori,
con licenza &lt;a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;CC-BY 4.0&lt;/a&gt; e
portate avanti dal progetto &lt;a href="https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;jdecked/twemoji&lt;/a&gt;.
Una presentazione che le mostra dovrebbe citarle, per esempio in un piè di pagina o in una
slide finale. La tabella degli shortcode è quella di markdown-it-emoji (MIT).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>